[1mCoverage[22m ([38;5;10mtranslation/tests/differential.rs[0m, 28 tests, both binaries spawned as subprocesses, comparing stdout/stderr/exit status): rather than hand-picking whitespace characters, I swept all 256 byte values in three positions — leading, as a digit-run terminator, and directly after a sign — which is how the vertical tab surfaced. Plus [38;5;10mint[0m/[38;5;10mlong[0m boundaries, glibc's saturate-then-truncate overflow ([38;5;10m99999999999999999999[0m → [38;5;10m-1[0m, negated → [38;5;10m0[0m), digit runs to 5000 chars, embedded NULs and non-UTF-8, a 64 KiB input the program never drains, stdin as [38;5;10m/dev/null[0m and as a directory, closed stdout, SIGPIPE, and a deterministic randomized sweep.[0m[0m
